// Burning mobs and their light: zombies on fire for the whole recording (a long fire timer, fire resistance so they
// never die, no AI so they stay put), at night for the light, at the crowd scene marked with /dsbench mark. Burning
// mobs light their surroundings with the flame jets' light (flameJetOptions.enableLight). See README.md for the format.
